 ('tina_loo',['environment','moral_regulation','cdn_political_national'],'States of Nature (2006), dams/scale/justice, relocation, and environmental-state research are already explicit. environment/canadian_environmental_history supplies substantial institutional and scholarly coverage of Wynn, MacEachern, Loo, Evenden, Piper, Sandlos, Colpitts and Parr. Standalone absence alone does not justify calling this a content gap.'),
